Negative control for the tickets linked-product mapping (FE-3206).

FE-3206 maps the ticket's linked `contract_product` through the contract-product
module's `mapContractProductEmbedded`, so the ticket serves the contract-product
view model (title, status badge, formatted price, billing cycle, dates). Rule home: the `mapTicket` JSDoc in `tickets.mappers.ts`.

The mutation passes the raw linked `contract_product` through untouched instead
of through `mapContractProductEmbedded`. The derived view-model readings never appear,
so the title/status/price/dates checks in
"useTicket — the linked ticket carries the full ContractProduct map" go RED.
Spec: packages/headless/src/modules/tickets/__tests__/tickets.reads.int.test.ts

